---
title: Deployment pipeline (dark theme from front matter)
config:
  theme: dark
  flowchart:
    curve: basis
---
flowchart LR
    dev[Developer] -->|git push| repo[(Repository)]
    repo --> ci{CI passes?}
    ci -- yes --> build[Build image]
    ci -- no --> notify[Notify author]
    build --> staging[Staging]
    staging --> approve{Approved?}
    approve -- yes --> prod[Production]
    approve -- no --> notify
